-- title:
--   Original Gaussian-only infinite-cap stopped Itô source witness
-- statement:
--   For the original Gaussian-only spectrally negative Lévy surplus with infinite dividend cap and positive initial reserve, prove a single centred integrable source variable dominating the exact original ruin-clipped discounted terminal value plus inclusive Stieltjes dividend cash. No integrability of the terminal is assumed. Use the Proved original HJB exponential bound, original clipped ruin clock, true stopped terminal nonnegativity and original exponential stopping envelope to prove terminal integrability; then use the Proved original zero-jump infinite-cap masked signed source with the constant clipped stopping time, and the Proved exact zero-clock payoff bound, to remove both the zero-stop mask and nonpositive residuals. This proves the infinite-cap subcase of the original five-witness Gaussian-only source, with no replacement process or local Lean compiler.

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_AvramDividend_Classical_SpectrallyNegativeLevy
import Definitions.Def_AvramDividend_Classical_DividendStrategy
open MeasureTheory Set Filter AvramDividend.Classical
